 Generalization of <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">Lemma 6.5.9 (2)</span>, <a href="/bibliography/BS">BS</a>]</span>. Compare with <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">Theorem 6.5</span>, <a href="/bibliography/HL-P">HL-P</a>]</span> in the setting of quasi-coherent modules and morphisms of (derived) algebraic stacks. 